":[4,\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#fashion\",\"className\":\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Fashion & Beauty French Names\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\",\"children\":[5,\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#places\",\"className\":\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"French Place Names for Pets\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[\"$L23\",\"$L24\"]}],\"$L25\",\"$L26\"]}]]}],\"$L27\",\"$L28\",\"$L29\",\"$L2a\",\"$L2b\",\"$L2c\",\"$L2d\",\"$L2e\",\"$L2f\",\"$L30\",\"$L31\",\"$L32\",\"$L33\",\"$L34\",\"$L35\",\"$L36\",\"$L37\",\"$L38\",\"$L39\",\"$L3a\",\"$L3b\",\"$L3c\",\"$L3d\",\"$L3e\"]}],\"$L3f\",\"$L40\",\"$L41\",\"$L42\",\"$L43\",\"$L44\"]}]\n23:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\",\"children\":[6,\".\"]}]\n24:[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#literary\",\"className\":\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"French Literary & Artistic Names\"}]\n25:[\"$\",\"li\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\",\"children\":[7,\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#gendered\",\"className\":\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Male & Female French Names\"}]]}]\n26:[\"$\",\"li\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\",\"children\":[8,\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#faq\",\"className\":\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}]]}]\n27:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Why French Names Have Universal Appeal\"]}]\n28:[\"$\",\"p\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"French pet names carry an undeniable elegance that transcends borders. There is something about the French language — its melodic rhythm, soft consonants, and romantic associations — that makes even simple words sound sophisticated. When you name your pet with a French name, you are not just choosing a label; you are wrapping your companion in a certain je ne sais quoi that makes introductions memorable and your bond feel uniquely special.\"]}]\n29:[\"$\",\"p\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"The appeal of French names extends beyond sound. France has contributed enormously to global culture through cuisine, fashion, art, literature, and philosophy. A French name can reflect your personal appreciation for any of these domains while giving your pet an identity that feels cultured and intentional. Whether you have visited Paris and want to carry a piece of that experience home, or simply love the aesthetic of French words, there is a French name waiting for your animal companion.\"]}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Many French names also adapt beautifully to English-speaking households. Words like Belle, Beau, Bijou, and Coco are already familiar to English speakers and require no special pronunciation skills. They are accessible yet distinctive — the perfect balance for a pet name.\"]}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Classic French Pet Names\"]}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Some French names have become timeless classics in the pet-naming world. These names have been loved for generations and continue to charm new pet owners:\"]}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Belle</strong> — Beautiful (feminine). Perfect for elegant female pets. <strong>Beau</strong> — Handsome (masculine). The male counterpart to Belle. <strong>Bijou</strong> — Jewel. For pets that are small and precious. <strong>Chérie</strong> — Darling, beloved. <strong>Chou</strong> — Cabbage, a common French term of endearment. <strong>Coco</strong> — A playful, unisex name associated with the iconic Coco Chanel. <strong>Fifi</strong> — A diminutive of Josephine, playful and feminine. <strong>Gigi</strong> — Charming and lively, popularized by the film and musical. <strong>Jolie</strong> — Pretty. <strong>Minou</strong> — Kitty, perfect for cats.\"}}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"French Food-Inspired Pet Names\"]}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"France is synonymous with culinary excellence, and French food terms make wonderfully endearing pet names. They are playful, memorable, and often quite cute:\"]}]\n30:[\"$\",\"p\",\"11\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Baguette</strong> — The iconic French bread, perfect for long, slim dogs like Dachshunds. <strong>Brioche</strong> — A sweet, buttery pastry — ideal for golden-colored pets. <strong>Crème</strong> — Cream, for light-colored or smooth-coated animals. <strong>Croissant</strong> — Crescent-shaped pastry, great for curled-up sleepers. <strong>Éclair</strong> — A闪电-shaped pastry, for fast or dark-colored pets. <strong>Fraise</strong> — Strawberry, sweet and red. <strong>Fromage</strong> — Cheese — quirky and fun. <strong>Mousse</strong> — Light and airy, for fluffy pets. <strong>Pêche</strong> — Peach, for sweet-natured companions. <strong>Truffle</strong> — A prized delicacy, for truly special pets.\"}}]\n31:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Fashion & Beauty French Names\"]}]\n32:[\"$\",\"p\",\"13\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Paris is the fashion capital of the world, and French designer names bring haute couture flair to your pet's identity. These names carry prestige and style:\"]}]\n33:[\"$\",\"p\",\"14\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Chanel</strong> — After Coco Chanel, the epitome of elegance. <strong>Dior</strong> — Sophisticated and refined. <strong>Givenchy</strong> — Distinctive and classy (Gigi for short). <strong>Hermès</strong> — Luxury and craftsmanship. <strong>Yves</strong> — After Yves Saint Laurent, artistic and bold. <strong>Balenciaga</strong> — Edgy and modern. <strong>Ambre</strong> — Amber, a warm, golden name. <strong>Bijou</strong> — Jewel, precious. <strong>Chic</strong> — Stylish — literally. <strong>Plume</strong> — Feather, light and delicate.\"}}]\n34:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"15\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"French Place Names for Pets\"]}]\n35:[\"$\",\"p\",\"16\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"France's geography offers a treasure trove of beautiful names. From romantic cities to sun-drenched regions, these place names make distinctive pet names:\"]}]\n36:[\"$\",\"p\",\"17\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Paris</strong> — The City of Light, universally recognized and romantic. <strong>Lyon</strong> — Historic and cultured. <strong>Bordeaux</strong> — Sophisticated, wine-country charm. <strong>Nice</strong> — Pronounced 'neese,' sunny and Mediterranean. <strong>Marseille</strong> — Vibrant port city energy. <strong>Provence</strong> — Lavender fields and rustic beauty. <strong>Versailles</strong> — Grand and opulent. <strong>Loire</strong> — Elegant, like the valley and river. <strong>Monet</strong> — After the painter, for artistic souls. <strong>Riviera</strong> — Glamorous coastline vibes.\"}}]\n37:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"18\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"French Literary & Artistic Names\"]}]\n38:[\"$\",\"p\",\"19\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"France has produced some of the world's greatest writers and artists. Their names carry intellectual weight and creative spirit:\"]}]\n39:[\"$\",\"p\",\"20\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Hugo</strong> — After Victor Hugo, author of Les Misérables. Strong and literary. <strong>Colette</strong> — The celebrated French novelist, feminine and spirited. <strong>Dumas</strong> — After Alexandre Dumas, adventurous and bold. <strong>Camus</strong> — Philosophical and cool. <strong>Degas</strong> — After the Impressionist painter. <strong>Matisse</strong> — Colorful and creative. <strong>Renoir</strong> — Warm and beautiful. <strong>Voltaire</strong> — Witty and sharp. <strong>Zola</strong> — Strong and passionate.\"}}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"21\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Male & Female French Names\"]}]\n3b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"22\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Male French Pet Names:</strong> André, Antoine, Baptiste, Claude, Étienne, François, Gabriel, Henri, Jacques, Jules, Léon, Louis, Luc, Marcel, Olivier, Pascal, Pierre, Raphaël, Rémy, Sébastien, Théo, Victor, Yves.\"}}]\n3c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"23\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Female French Pet Names:</strong> Amélie, Anaïs, Aurélie, Camille, Céleste, Chloé, Clarisse, Delphine, Élodie, Esmé, Fleur, Geneviève, Inès, Juliette, Léa, Madeleine, Manon, Margot, Odette, Rosalie, Simone, Sophie, Sylvie, Violette, Yvette.\"}}]\n3d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"24\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Explore our name generators for \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"32\",{\"href\":\"/animal/african-slender-snouted-crocodile/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"African Slender-Snouted Crocodile\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"69\",{\"href\":\"/animal/alpaca/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Alpaca\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"79\",{\"href\":\"/animal/aardwolf/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Aardwolf\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"91\",{\"href\":\"/animal/andean-cock-of-the-rock/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Andean Cock-of-the-Rock\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", and \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"122\",{\"href\":\"/animal/archerfish/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Archerfish\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" to find the perfect name for your companion.\"]}]\n3e:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"25\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Frequently Asked Questions\"]}]\n3f:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Do I need to pronounce French names perfectly?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Not at all. Pets respond to tone and consistency, not accent accuracy. Choose a pronunciation that feels natural to you and use it consistently.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What are the most popular French dog names?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"$undefined\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Can French names work for any type of pet?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Absolutely. French names work beautifully for dogs, cats, birds, rabbits, horses, and even reptiles. The elegance of French transcends species.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Are there French names specifically for certain breeds?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Yes. French breeds like Poodles, French Bulldogs, Dogue de Bordeaux, and Papillons pair naturally with French names, but any breed can carry a French name beautifully.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What if my family doesn't speak French?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"That is completely fine. Many English speakers use French names like Belle, Beau, and Coco without speaking the language. They are internationally recognized and easy to use.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n40:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"🐾 Related Animal Name Generators\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"salamander\",{\"href\":\"/animal/salamander/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🦎\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Salamander\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"unicorn-tang\",{\"href\":\"/animal/unicorn-tang/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐟\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Unicorn Tang\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"great-egret\",{\"href\":\"/animal/great-egret/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🦤\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Great Egret\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"siberian-tiger\",{\"href\":\"/animal/siberian-tiger/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",nul