 font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Classic Hamster Names — Top Classic Picks 🐹\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n42:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"📝 Related Articles\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"animal-naming-traditions-around-the-world\",{\"href\":\"/blog/animal-naming-traditions-around-the-world/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl mb-3\",\"children\":\"🌍\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"Cultural Names\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Animal Naming Traditions Around the World: How Different Cultures Name Their Pets\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Explore fascinating animal naming traditions from cultures worldwide. From Japanese temple names to Nordic mythological names, discover how different societies name their beloved pets.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"chinese-animal-names-symbolism-meaning\",{\"href\":\"/blog/chinese-animal-names-symbolism-meaning/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl mb-3\",\"children\":\"🐉\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"Cultural Names\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Chinese Animal Names: Symbolism, Meaning & 200+ Beautiful Choices\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Discover the beauty of Chinese animal names and their deep cultural symbolism. From dragons to pandas, explore meaningful Chinese names perfect for pets with rich cultural heritage.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"italian-pet-names-bella-naming-guide\",{\"href\":\"/blog/italian-pet-names-bella-naming-guide/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl mb-3\",\"children\":\"🍝\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"Cultural Names\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Italian Pet Names: La Dolce Vita — 200+ Bella Ideas for Your Beloved Companion\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Fall in love with Italian pet names that capture the warmth and passion of Italy. From food-inspired to romantic classics, discover the perfect Italian name for your pet.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"spanish-pet-names-vibrant-passionate-ideas\",{\"href\":\"/blog/spanish-pet-names-vibrant-passionate-ideas/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl mb-3\",\"children\":\"💃\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"Cultural Names\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Spanish Pet Names: 200+ Vibrant & Passionate Ideas for Your Animal Friend\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Discover passionate Spanish pet names full of warmth and energy. From traditional classics to modern favorites, find the perfect Spanish name for dogs, cats, and all pets.\"}]]}],\"$L45\",\"$L46\"]}]]}]\n43:[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\",\"aria-label\":\"Post navigation\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog/chinese-animal-names-symbolism-meaning/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-500\",\"children\":\"← Previous Post\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\",\"children\":\"Chinese Animal Names: Symbolism, Meaning & 200+ Beautiful Choices\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog/italian-pet-names-bella-naming-guide/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-right\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-500\",\"children\":\"Next Post →\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\",\"children\":\"Italian Pet Names: La Dolce Vita — 200+ Bella Ideas for Your Beloved Companion\"}]]}]]}]\n44:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 p-6 bg-primary/5 rounded-2xl border border-primary/10 text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2\",\"children\":\"🐾 Ready to find the perfect animal name?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-600 mb-4\",\"children\":\"Browse our complete collection of 200+ animal name generators — all 100% free.\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/an